  {"cat":"Docker","name":"配置docker国内镜像加速","cmd":"sudo tee /etc/docker/daemon.json <<'EOF'\n{\n  \"registry-mirrors\": [\"https://docker.m.daocloud.io\"]\n}\nEOF","desc":"设置国内镜像后需要restart重启docker","sample":""},
  {"cat":"Docker","name":"创建Docker服务代理","cmd":"sudo mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/docker.service.d && sudo tee /etc/systemd/system/docker.service.d/http-proxy.conf <<'EOF'\n[Service]\nEnvironment=\"HTTP_PROXY=socks5://192.168.1.4:7897\"\nEnvironment=\"HTTPS_PROXY=socks5://192.168.1.4:7897\"\nEnvironment=\"NO_PROXY=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1\"\nEOF","desc":"注意：这个设置会导致redis拉取镜像某几层最后下载失败","sample":""},
  {"cat":"Docker","name":"查看Docker代理配置","cmd":"sudo cat /etc/systemd/system/docker.service.d/http-proxy.conf","desc":"","sample":""},
